# UI remote entry override.
#
# By default (dev and production) this remote loads the deployed design system,
# so `npm run dev` works without tvmaze-ui running locally:
#
#   https://abn-challenge.github.io/tvmaze-ui/remoteEntry.js
#
# To develop against a local tvmaze-ui, either run `npm run dev:local` (which
# sets the var for you) or copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and
# uncomment the line below.

# VITE_UI_REMOTE_URL=http://localhost:5001/remoteEntry.js
